ship = Claudia launch orbit test
version = 1.12.5
description = Block test craft for launch and circularize: the exec_node craft (OKTO2 probe core, kOS KR-2042, two Z-200 batteries, Mk16 chute, TD-12 decoupler, FL-T800, LV-T45) with a Small Inline Reaction Wheel under the chute (the OKTO2 has none, and the upper stage needs one to hold attitude between stages and while coasting), over a TD-12 decoupler, FL-T800 and LV-T45 with three AV-R8 winglets. Stock parts plus kOS, KSP 1.12.5.
